oindent Now note that $ oldsymbol{\epsilon}$ and $	exttt{P}_X^{\perp}$ are independent. As a result, when conditioning on $	exttt{P}_X^{\perp}$, we have from Lemma ef{lem:concentration_width} that  egin{align*} \p \left(\sup_{\Delta \in \mc{T}} |
