norm{	exttt{P}_X^{\perp}}_2 \leq 1$. Choosing $t = (1 + \sqrt{2}) \sigma \{w(\mc{T}) \vee \log n \}$, combining this result with i), and putting together the pieces in \eqref{eq:Pi_apply_Gordon}, the assertion of the lemma follows. \end{proof} 
